        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "In accordance with 39 U.S.C. 3642 and 39 CFR 3020.30 et seq., the Postal Service filed a formal request and associated supporting information to add Priority Mail & First-Class Package Service Contract 6 to the competitive product list. $ ^{1} $",
